    "Details": "The -6M is a bit of a weird take on the Serket, switching from its usual support role to a much more direct design. Six SRM-6 launchers and two Magshot Cannons provide impressive close range fire capabilities, but a downsized Naval Laser mounted on the 'Mech's back can still cause surprising damage at longer ranges of engagement.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.32</color></b>",
